# Every text file in this repository is LF, in the working tree and in the
# object store, on every platform.
#
# Without this a Windows checkout converts to CRLF and the 786 golden files stop
# matching what the renderer produces, which is always LF. The failure is
# especially unpleasant to read: the test prints two blocks that look
# byte-identical and says they differ.
#
# eol=lf also normalizes on the way in, so an editor that writes CRLF cannot
# commit one. text=auto still detects genuinely binary content and leaves it
# alone, so this stays correct for any non-text fixture we add later.
* text=auto eol=lf
